Package: flowdocks
Version: 0.4.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Hashir Ahmad <hashirahmad8055@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6 (>= 6.4), libx11-6, x11-utils, xdotool, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: papirus-icon-theme
Description: animated application dock for X11 desktops
 A PyQt6 desktop dock with application shortcuts, running-window indicators,
 preferences and optional user-controlled autostart.
 Icons can be dragged to reorder, pinned by dropping them from the application
 picker and unpinned by dragging them off the dock. The dock itself can be
 dragged to any screen edge on any monitor. Its stacking can be set to normal,
 above or below other windows, and it can be shown or hidden with a global
 shortcut, a screen edge hotspot or the --toggle command.
 X11 with a compositing window manager is the supported desktop environment;
 native Wayland integration is limited.
